{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o146a","title":"册命曹操十郡为国并加九锡","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o146a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命以河东等十郡封曹操为魏公，仍以丞相领冀州牧，加九锡。","evidence":["wudi-e-o146a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o147a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐大辂、戎辂各一，玄牡二驷。","evidence":["wudi-e-o147a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o148a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐衮冕之服与赤舄。","evidence":["wudi-e-o148a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o149a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐轩悬之乐、六佾之舞。","evidence":["wudi-e-o149a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o150a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐朱户以居。","evidence":["wudi-e-o150a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o151a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐纳陛以登。","evidence":["wudi-e-o151a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o152a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐虎贲之士三百人。","evidence":["wudi-e-o152a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o153a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐斧钺各一。","evidence":["wudi-e-o153a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o154a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐彤弓、彤矢及玈弓、玈矢。","evidence":["wudi-e-o154a-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o155a-account","label":"正文","text":"册命赐秬鬯一卣及珪瓒。","evidence":["wudi-e-o155a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"封赐","evidence":["wudi-e-o146a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受封","evidence":["wudi-e-o146a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"河东、河内、魏郡、赵国、中山、常山、钜鹿、安平、甘陵、平原","evidence":["wudi-e-o146a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十八年五月丙申","year":213,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o146a-q","wudi-q-o139","wudi-q-b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5"],"chronology":"wudi-y213","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o139","basis":"建安十八年五月丙申","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,790,"O146a"],"order":334}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0054","name":"汉献帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o146a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d76d93442b18138d5f40","layer":"original","quote":"朕以眇眇之身，托于兆民之上，永思厥艰，若涉渊（冰）〔水〕〖86〗。非君攸济，朕无任焉。今以冀州之河东、河内、魏郡、赵国、中山、常山、钜鹿、安平、甘陵、平原凡十郡〖87〗，封君为魏公；锡君玄土〖88〗，苴以白茅〖89〗；爰契尔龟〖90〗，用建冢社〖91〗。昔在周室，毕公、毛公入为卿佐〖92〗，周、邵师保出为二伯〖93〗。外内之任，君实宜之；其以丞相领冀州牧如故。又加君九锡〖94〗，其敬听朕命：","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":114,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":197},{"id":"wudi-e-o147a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e17c4ab75ea7559fe375","layer":"original","quote":"以君经纬礼律〖95〗，为民轨仪，使安职业，无或迁志。是用锡君大辂、戎辂各一，玄牡二驷〖96〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"wudi-e-o148a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-77697d9f7af6f30bce8b","layer":"original","quote":"君劝分务本〖97〗，穑人昏作〖98〗，﹝七﹞粟帛滞积，大业惟兴。是用锡君衮冕之服〖99〗，赤舄副焉〖100〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":116,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"wudi-e-o149a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-92f61847909ff97ccbdd","layer":"original","quote":"君敦尚谦让，俾民兴行〖101〗，少长有礼，上下咸和。是用锡君轩悬之乐〖102〗，六佾之舞〖103〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50},{"id":"wudi-e-o150a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ae0630d1ebb8575e257a","layer":"original","quote":"君翼宣风化，爰发四方，远人革面〖104〗，华夏充实。是用锡君朱户以居〖105〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wudi-e-o151a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3aa8448ce4b53970f36d","layer":"original","quote":"君研其明哲，思帝所难〖106〗，官才任贤，群善必举。是用锡君纳陛以登〖107〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wudi-e-o152a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1aa3aef66c03f3459791","layer":"original","quote":"君秉国之钧，正色处中〖108〗，纤毫之恶，靡不抑退。是用锡君虎贲之士三百人。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38},{"id":"wudi-e-o153a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d4153ce6c3591739e4f8","layer":"original","quote":"君纠虔天刑〖109〗，彰厥有罪〖110〗，﹝八﹞犯关干纪〖111〗，莫不诛殛〖112〗。是用锡君&、钺各一。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"wudi-e-o154a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4ede09e52d35535831a1","layer":"original","quote":"君龙骧虎视〖113〗，旁眺八维，掩讨逆节，折冲四海〖114〗。是用锡君彤弓一〖115〗，彤矢百，玈弓十〖116〗，玈矢千。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61},{"id":"wudi-e-o155a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e128e5fcc2142aafa38f","layer":"original","quote":"君以温恭为基，孝友为德，明允笃诚〖117〗，感于朕思。是用锡君秬鬯一卣〖118〗，珪、瓒副焉〖119〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52},{"id":"wudi-q-b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗十八年：建安十八年（公元 213）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bec99dfe67d67ae54b06","start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-o139","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d44820525c4645832365","layer":"original","quote":"十八年春正月〖11〗，进军濡须口〖12〗；攻破权江西营，获权都督公孙阳〖13〗，乃引军还。诏书并十四州〖14〗，复为九州〖15〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
